    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Assumptions\n",
        "\n",
        "#### Higher order modes\n",
        "\n",
        "We perform the analysis using only the 22 mode, and the following plot shows this is an excellent approximation for light sources such as these:\n"
      ],
      "id": "be14082c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
